<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean feed millers seek 104,500T feed grains.</title>
<headline>S.Korean feed millers seek 104,500T feed grains.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine South Korean feed mill companies including Sunjin Feed Co Ltd and Je il Feed Co Ltd invited tenders for a total of 52,500 tonnes of corn and 52,000 tonnes of feed wheat by 5.00 p.m. (0800 GMT) on Wednesday, traders said.  </p>
<p>Traders said the delivery of the corn was set for July 25 and the wheat delivery was set for January 25. Arrival was set for Inchon and Kunsan.</p>
<p>Details for the tenders are as follows:</p>
<p>Commod   Tonne	     Shipment			     Origin</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>			U.S.Gulf(Argentine)	 PNW</p>
<p>Corn     52,500   Jun 7-26		 Jun 26-Jul 15    W/Wide</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>			Canada(Australia)	   EU</p>
<p>Wheat    52,000   Dec 10-29		Nov 21-dec 10    W/Wide</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
